    {
      "turn": 1,
      "doctor_question": "Hello. What brings you into the clinic today?",
      "targeted_symptom": "S022",
      "patient_response": "Hello, Doctor. Thank you for fitting me in, I really appreciate it. I hope I'm not taking up too much of your time. \n\nWell, my family actually brought me in today. I guess... I guess I caused a bit of a fuss at the county fair, which I feel just terrible about. I hope you don't think too badly of me, but... I was giving a talk about the equipment, and I climbed up onto the tractor. I just wanted to show the crowd this new pattern I'd figured out. I was jerking the controls around to demonstrate it to them, and... well, I just couldn't seem to make myself stop doing it, even when folks started yelling at me to get down. \n\nI know it probably looked really strange, and I'm usually much more professional than that, I promise. I really didn't mean to cause any trouble. Does that make sense why they'd want me to come see you?",
